{"questions":[{"question":"Kva er $a^{\\frac{1}{n}}$ skrive som rot?","options":["$\\sqrt[n]{a}$","$a^n$","$\\frac{1}{a^n}$","$n\\sqrt{a}$"],"explanation":"Ein brøkeksponent $\\frac{1}{n}$ svarar til den $n$-te rota: $a^{\\frac{1}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a}$."},{"question":"Kva er $16^{\\frac{1}{2}}$?","options":["$4$","$8$","$256$","$2$"],"explanation":"$16^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{16} = 4$."},{"question":"Kva er $8^{\\frac{2}{3}}$?","options":["$4$","$16$","$8$","$2$"],"explanation":"$8^{\\frac{2}{3}} = (\\sqrt[3]{8})^2 = 2^2 = 4$."},{"question":"Forenkle $x^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{3}{2}}$.","options":["$x^2$","$x^{\\frac{3}{4}}$","$x^3$","$x$"],"explanation":"Legg saman eksponentane: $x^{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{3}{2}} = x^2$."},{"question":"Kva er $4^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$?","options":["$\\frac{1}{2}$","$2$","$-2$","$\\frac{1}{4}$"],"explanation":"$4^{-\\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4}} = \\frac{1}{2}$."}],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"a974c96cc6268ee0","translatedAt":"2026-06-21T22:01:12.964Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":20,"tm":{"49d26c1f6bb260cf":"Kva er $a^{\\frac{1}{n}}$ skrive som rot?","ec1caa7b5ad22214":"$\\sqrt[n]{a}$","51fe62b2671099bc":"$a^n$","a1056f1dcafa741e":"$\\frac{1}{a^n}$","9fa31c0036043e90":"$n\\sqrt{a}$","435dbe201c39e206":"Ein brøkeksponent $\\frac{1}{n}$ svarar til den $n$-te rota: $a^{\\frac{1}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a}$.","728a015ab39b8435":"Kva er $16^{\\frac{1}{2}}$?","3f025cf32c72e0fc":"$16^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{16} = 4$.","3cbcc60e3cec397d":"Kva er $8^{\\frac{2}{3}}$?","08272456ecfa8e4a":"$8^{\\frac{2}{3}} = (\\sqrt[3]{8})^2 = 2^2 = 4$.","33349795f3a13551":"Forenkle $x^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{3}{2}}$.","7f408224ea7b716f":"$x^2$","2bf9a5d9e1789ed0":"$x^{\\frac{3}{4}}$","f7622630b2d61c0b":"$x^3$","22bf003d6cac79e1":"$x$","ac9ca57fd0387d47":"Legg saman eksponentane: $x^{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{3}{2}} = x^2$.","8fb06a5e89dac2de":"Kva er $4^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$?","b61def0872c567fe":"$\\frac{1}{2}$","f2bf6d932e14b55c":"$\\frac{1}{4}$","c167a88ccd7